  "text": "AFK General Graardor Hard Mode\n\n​\nDisclaimer\n⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S)\n‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work\n​\nPositioning\n⬥ Positioning yourself in Melee distance of where General Graardor spawns helps, but is not mandatory.\n​\nMelee AFK Method (55+ kph) \nOverview\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work:\n    • Cutting corners will result in failure\n    • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel\n\nItems\n⬥ Essence of Finality  or Amulet of souls \n⬥ Scrimshaw of vampyrism \n⬥ Full cryptbloom armour  \n⬥ Igneous Kal-Ket  or Igneous Kal-Zuk \nAbilities\n⬥ Chaos Roar  \n⬥ Greater Fury \nOther\n⬥ Animate Dead \n⬥ Prism of Restoration \n⬥ Pray Turmoil  and Soul Split \n    • Malevolence  and Stone of Jas  buff not recommended. They can speed up kills, but sometimes kill the player during Graardor's reflect, especially when used together.\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n\n​\nPresets and Relics \n⬥ Melee preset \n​\n​\n\nAction Bars \n\n​\nExample Kills \n⬥ Melee\n\n\n​\n      \n    ",
  "normalizedText": "AFK General Graardor Hard Mode ​ Disclaimer ⬥ IF YOU CANNOT GET A METHOD TO WORK DO NOT MESSAGE THE CREATOR(S) ‎ ‎ ‎ ‎• It is more than likely user error or cutting corners, use #pvm-help if you cannot get it to work ​ Positioning ⬥ Positioning yourself in Melee distance of where General Graardor spawns helps, but is not mandatory. ​ Melee AFK Method (55+ kph) Overview ⬥ The following ARE REQUIRED for this method to work: • Cutting corners will result in failure • A more extensive list can be found in #unknown-channel Items ⬥ Essence of Finality or Amulet of souls ⬥ Scrimshaw of vampyrism ⬥ Full cryptbloom armour ⬥ Igneous Kal-Ket or Igneous Kal-Zuk Abilities ⬥ Chaos Roar ⬥ Greater Fury Other ⬥ Animate Dead ⬥ Prism of Restoration ⬥ Pray Turmoil and Soul Split • Malevolence and Stone of Jas buff not recommended. They can speed up kills, but sometimes kill the player during Graardor's reflect, especially when used together. ​ Presets and Relics ⬥ Melee preset ​ ​ Action Bars ​ Example Kills ⬥ Melee ​",
